# The GeoIP databases are read by this install, never served: a GeoLite2
# database the refresh downloads is licensed for this install's use (the
# GeoLite EULA, section 6.1, forbids disclosing it to third parties), and an
# ISP database is a paid one. A rewrite, as tracking202/update/reports/ does,
# because it needs only the AllowOverride the README asks for; the README's
# vhosts and the Docker image also deny the directory where nginx, or
# AllowOverride None, never reads this file.
Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule .* - [F]
